                            	  4628: _L_z01__CalcDiagonalSpeedIndex_Swap:
                            	  4629:     ; TODO: call it speed index or angle?
                            	  4630:     ; If the difference in distances is within 8 pixels,
                            	  4631:     ; return the speed index (angle) we have.
