                            	 12276:     ; surrounded on 3 sides, then the loop above would get stuck in
                            	 12277:     ; an infinite loop.
                            	 12278:     ;
                            	 12279:     ; But, the only room with that configuration has those blocks
                            	 12280:     ; blocked off with a push block, which can only be pushed after
                            	 12281:     ; all monsters are killed.
                            	 12282:     ;
02:0003EE90 4E75            	 12283:     rts
                            	 12284: 
                            	 12285:     even
