                            	 12691:     ; If the monster is Patra Child 1 ($25), then look up two separate
                            	 12692:     ; counts of bits to use for Y and X increment calculations in rotation.
                            	 12693:     ; This leads to a large circle (6,6) and a wobbling ring (5,6).
