02:00044802 4EB900030E8E    	  7622:     jsr     AddToInt16At0
                            	  7623:     ; Assume that we'll write a type 1 square with primary square
                            	  7624:     ; taken from [05]. If so, the square index doesn't matter
                            	  7625:     ; as long as >= $10. See WriteSquareOW.
                            	  7626:     ;
